Mutation
- [N1] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n5,"v1 = 'Yes'"); source=i4:is accepted; reason=The guard substitutes the explicit textual condition 'is accepted' with an abstract variable assignment 'v1 = Yes', distorting the source logic/value.
- [N2] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n8,"v1 = 'No'"); source=i6:is rejected; reason=The guard substitutes the explicit textual condition 'is rejected' with an abstract variable assignment 'v1 = No', distorting the source logic/value.
